  "description": "MUWLIB crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C74 H104 N8 O25 Tb5 1+,Cl1 1-,10.5(H2 O1),2(C1 H4 O1),2(C1 H1 Cl3). From the CIF bond table, Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.521-3.669 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.58-98.60°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb5(LH)4(η1-Piv)(η2-Piv)3(μ2-η2η1-Piv)2(H2O)]Cl·10.5H2O·2MeOH·2CHCl3. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
